 {"recommendationid": "220777155", "author": {"steamid": "76561198000367036", "personaname": "Gorgon Freeman", "persona_status": "online", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/id/threestooges689/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 16, "playtime_forever": 11575, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 102, "playtime_at_review": 6210, "last_played": 1790456227, "avatar": "b441b9c5bd6452bcc16472b4cde5cb79c808b3fc"}, "language": "english", "review": "I got more addicted to this game than I thought I would. Friend convinced me to play it and I ended up playing it more than him. It challenges you while allowing you to slowly ramp up your difficulty. Having up to 3 friends join you and get independent upgrades from one another lets you share when you want to (pinging your items) while being able to have your build without contest (RNG aside of course) \nSome of the unlocked skins are upsetting as they often repeat (the blue and red camos) but the ones that don't repeat are nice to have and can be a fun way to flex your progress when playing with others. \nI would love to see more updates pushed but with a small developer ( I believe it is only one person ) and with the variety of weapons in the game already, it gives you plenty to work towards and hours of fun taking down hoards and bosses with or without friends.", "timestamp_created": 1773608939, "timestamp_updated": 1773608939, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 2, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": "0.501300990581512451", "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": true, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1680364802", "reactions": []}, {"recommendationid": "220773508", "author": {"steamid": "76561198079526422", "personaname": "Chungles", "persona_status": "offline", "profile_url": "https://steamcommunity.com/profiles/76561198079526422/", "num_games_owned": 0, "num_reviews": 6, "playtime_forever": 151, "playtime_last_two_weeks":